   Panel titles, section labels, notes and counts use the type scale; places you are in (a sheet, a shoot) and the
   option you picked use the one raised-chip selection, while layers keep the selection tint they share with the canvas box;
   every floating palette and popover is a bottom drawer on a phone; Grid's header row is the LumaUI table header;
   Darkroom's photo information is the LumaUI details pane. */
