/* ══ Write in the suite (25 Sep) ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
   Write is a creative-suite app, built from the suite's parts. The title bar names the document; the island is a desk
   with the paper on it; the Outline floats at the left (Word's navigation pane: find and replace, then the headings);
   the inspector floats at the right with Format (it follows what you're in: a paragraph, a table, a photo) and
   Comments; the Word row sits at the foot and morphs for tables and photos. Page and zoom live in the bottom corners.
   Paper is Write's one named exception: it stays paper in every mode. */
