/* on a phone the places button lives in the island, not the title bar */
@container win (max-width: 560px) { #w-youtube > .tbar .lsidebtn { display: none; } }

/* ── Tablet (desktop/phone.js formOf: a 760 short side with a 1024 long side; desktop/pocket.css has the panes) ──
   What each app adds to the shared layer: the sidebar's rows, the views in the title row, where its bars sit. */
/* Filer: the icon rail opens into rows, as the phone's drawer does; the bar keeps a phone's width under the page */
